  "descriptionHtml": "<p>A small bag that's no slouch—our Lenox mini crossbody comes in pebbled leather with a top zip and an interior zip pocket. Structured by design, it's shaped to keep your essentials where you put them. We like how it ups the put-together factor on even the most casual of weekend looks.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled Leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (black, meringue, elm, desert sunset, enchanted green, warm gingerbread); silver hardware (north star, dahlia pink, rose smoke, light sand)</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustible, removable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 8.2&quot; (L) x 4.7&quot; (H) x 2.70&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
